wf-specialist-kit-full = Your faction has taken every one of this kit it may this round. More open up as more of you come online.
wf-specialist-kit-job = This kit is for another job.
ent-WFSpecialistVendorTSF = TSFMC specialist rack
    .desc = An automated rack of specialist kits. Each marine may draw one.
ent-WFSpecialistVendorPDV = Vanguard specialist rack
    .desc = An automated rack of specialist kits. Each soldier of the Vanguard may draw one.
ent-WFKitTsfBreacher = breacher kit
    .desc = M3-G4 grenadier armor, an Enforcer shotgun, breaching charges, a telescopic shield and flashbangs. First through the airlock.
ent-WFKitTsfCombatEngineer = combat engineer kit
    .desc = M3-T armor, a Drozd SMG, an Mk290 turret, an industrial welder, building sheets and a spare plate. Engineers only.
ent-WFKitTsfCorpsman = corpsman kit
    .desc = An M82b corpsman suit, a sidearm, an advanced surgery duffel, a combat medkit and blood packs. Corpsmen only.
ent-WFKitTsfMarksman = marksman kit
    .desc = An M45 ghillie suit, a Riversong rifle, binoculars and smoke. Overwatch.
ent-WFKitTsfPyrotechnician = pyrotechnician kit
    .desc = M35 fire-rated armor, an Enforcer shotgun with incendiary shells, and incendiary grenades.
ent-WFKitTsfRecon = recon kit
    .desc = XM4 armor with a built-in motion tracker, a Drozd SMG, a wearable camera, a jetpack and binoculars.
ent-WFKitTsfHeavyGunner = heavy gunner kit
    .desc = An ML66A heavy harness, a Grizzly LMG with spare boxes and a telescopic shield. Fireteam leaders only.
ent-WFKitTsfShipGunner = ship gunner kit
    .desc = M3-L armor, a sidearm, a military gunnery chip and magboots, for crewing ship weapons.
ent-WFKitPdvBoarder = boarder kit
    .desc = UM5CU commando armor, an MLA-73 SMG, an energy cutlass, jaws of life, an access breaker and smoke.
ent-WFKitPdvArtificer = artificer kit
    .desc = UL6 support armor, an AK, a C4 bundle, mines, an industrial welder and plasteel. Artificers only.
ent-WFKitPdvFieldMedic = field medic kit
    .desc = A CV-82 medic suit, a sidearm, hypopens, a nanite applicator and blood packs. Jarrah only.
ent-WFKitPdvSharpshooter = sharpshooter kit
    .desc = A UDEP thermal poncho, a sniper rifle case, binoculars and smoke.
ent-WFKitPdvHeavy = heavy kit
    .desc = UH7 heavy plated armor, an LMG duffel and a telescopic shield. Denasvar only.
ent-WFKitPdvBurner = burner kit
    .desc = A militia hauberk, a Burner rifle duffel and incendiary grenades.
ent-WFKitPdvAkinciRaider = akıncı raider kit
    .desc = A CCC5 tactical vest, a Vympel rifle, a chameleon PDA and backpack, and a radio jammer. Named for the Dynasty's frontier raiders.
ent-WFKitPdvTopcu = topçu kit
    .desc = UL6 armor, a sidearm, a military gunnery chip and magboots, for crewing ship weapons. Named for the Dynasty's artillerymen.

